WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,590 --> 00:00:02,990
That made Grandma laugh

2
00:00:02,990 --> 00:00:05,390
Ah, it is Grandma Oreo

3
00:00:05,390 --> 00:00:11,700
Wait — is that a wolf?

4
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:12,900
Be good, little Huihui

5
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:14,700
We are home!

6
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:18,560
It is this dog

7
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:21,400
Even dogs are snobs these days

8
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:22,600
Everyone, shut up!

9
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:23,800
Hello, Uncle

10
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:24,800
Hello, big sister

11
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:26,000
I am Yoyo

12
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,980
Miss Yoyo

13
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:30,220
You have finally arrived

14
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:31,820
Let me take that bag for you

15
00:00:31,820 --> 00:00:32,820
No need

16
00:00:32,820 --> 00:00:34,620
These are gifts from Yoyo

17
00:00:34,620 --> 00:00:36,580
for Grandpa, Grandma and my brothers

18
00:00:36,580 --> 00:00:37,980
Hometown specialties?

19
00:00:37,980 --> 00:00:39,700
A little beggar from the countryside

20
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:42,620
how dare she enter the Pei family home

21
00:00:42,620 --> 00:00:44,940
Miss Yoyo is the Pei family true daughter

22
00:00:44,940 --> 00:00:46,540
The real daughter?

23
00:00:46,540 --> 00:00:48,020
Miss Jiaojiao, whom our family raised

24
00:00:48,020 --> 00:00:49,340
is the apple of our eye

25
00:00:49,340 --> 00:00:50,420
She came from the countryside

26
00:00:50,420 --> 00:00:57,490
Who knows what germs she carries

27
00:00:57,490 --> 00:00:59,330
Keep it up and I will stew you into dog hotpot

28
00:00:59,330 --> 00:01:01,520
I cannot understand it

29
00:01:01,520 --> 00:01:03,620
but it sounds really dirty

30
00:01:03,620 --> 00:01:05,140
Damn old woman

31
00:01:05,140 --> 00:01:06,620
You look like a hotpot to me

32
00:01:06,620 --> 00:01:08,140
Your whole family is hotpot

33
00:01:08,300 --> 00:01:09,780
How dare you bully our Yoyo

34
00:01:09,780 --> 00:01:11,900
I will bite your leg off!

35
00:01:11,900 --> 00:01:18,030
You... you bite?!

36
00:01:18,030 --> 00:01:18,950
If I were you

37
00:01:18,950 --> 00:01:20,710
I would grab my junk and roll out

38
00:01:20,750 --> 00:01:23,010
Welcome, Yoyo

39
00:01:23,010 --> 00:01:24,650
You are the reborn ancestor of the Yushou Sect

40
00:01:24,650 --> 00:01:25,810
with the Heavenly Dao protecting you

41
00:01:25,810 --> 00:01:27,690
They need a lesson

42
00:01:27,690 --> 00:01:28,890
How about I fake rabies

43
00:01:28,890 --> 00:01:29,850
You will fake rabies?

44
00:01:29,850 --> 00:01:34,460
and scare them

45
00:01:34,460 --> 00:01:35,500
Since when

46
00:01:35,500 --> 00:01:38,750
does a maid drive out the true daughter of the Pei family

47
00:01:38,750 --> 00:01:40,670
I just feel sorry for Miss Jiaojiao

48
00:01:40,670 --> 00:01:42,390
She cried all last night

49
00:01:42,390 --> 00:01:44,380
and got sick enough for the hospital

50
00:01:44,380 --> 00:01:45,780
Her name is Pei Yoyo

51
00:01:45,780 --> 00:01:47,100
She is my biological sister

52
00:01:47,100 --> 00:01:50,380
Did everyone hear that? Dismissed.

53
00:01:50,380 --> 00:01:51,420
Someone so small

54
00:01:51,420 --> 00:01:57,240
carrying such a big bag — here, brothers

55
00:01:57,240 --> 00:01:58,640
It is heavy

56
00:01:58,640 --> 00:02:00,240
How heavy can a brat bag be?

57
00:02:00,240 --> 00:02:03,380
I cannot even lift one

58
00:02:03,380 --> 00:02:05,300
a tiny bag of a brat
